OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a dry bright morning
OL,6,Fcloud and rain will spread east in the
OL,7,Fafternoon, rain will be intermittent
OL,8,Fand mostly light, some areas in East
OL,9,FFife staying dry, quite breezy again.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRain dying out and cloud
OL,12,Fbreaking with the chance of some
OL,13,Fevening sun towards the Angus coast.
OL,14,FClear spells overnight, a few showers
OL,15,Fperhaps reaching the west, windy at
OL,16,Ftimes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
