OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FBright and breezy with
OL,6,Foccasional showers in the morning,
OL,7,Fespecially for Perthshire, mostly dry
OL,8,Ftowards Dundee and St Andrews. Fresh
OL,9,Fwinds at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMostly
OL,12,Fdry and bright on Sunday and less
OL,13,Fwindy than previous days, unsettled on
OL,14,FMonday and Tuesday with some rain but
OL,15,Falso some brighter weather.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
